  "text": "### 2. Fee Disputes  \n**Example:** Unexpected charge, overdraft fee, card replacement fee  \n**Investigation:**\n- Review terms & conditions\n- Check if fee applied correctly\n- Assess if fee disclosed clearly\n- Review customer history  \n**Resolution:**\n- If fee applied correctly per T&Cs: Explain and decline reversal\n- If fee error: Reverse charge + interest\n- If unclear T&Cs: Refund + apology",
